acknowledging to other people that they have these feelings. So what ends up happening is, is that BIPOC students in predominantly white spaces are well aware of the perception that they, by son, that they don't belong there, that they're simply there because of affirmative action. And so they want to sort of prove to others and to themselves that though I belong here because of my achievements and because I am meritorious,
向其他人承认他们有这种感受。所以最终发生的情况是，多元族裔学生在主要是白人的空间里，非常清楚地意识到这样一种看法：由他们自己感知到的，他们不属于这里，他们来这里只是因为平权行动（affirmative action）。所以他们想要向别人和自己证明，尽管我属于这里是因为我的成就，因为我有功绩，

